497,1662,1663],{},"BroadcastChannel"," 与页面通信。它只改变你要求的东西：拖拽、选中集合和选项覆盖。",[1666,1667,1668],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sbwC8, html code.shiki .sbwC8{--shiki-light:#0969DA;--shiki-default:#0969DA;--shiki-dark:#7CC4FF}html pre.shiki code .sN8r7, html code.shiki .sN8r7{--shiki-light:#9A6700;--shiki-default:#9A6700;--shiki-dark:#E9C46A}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html.dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html pre.shiki code .s78Kj, html code.shiki .s78Kj{--shiki-light:#1F8A5B;--shiki-default:#1F8A5B;--shiki-dark:#42B883}html pre.shiki code .s6cML, html code.shiki .s6cML{--shiki-light:#5B5B63;--shiki-default:#5B5B63;--shiki-dark:#9F9FA9}html pre.shiki code .snmWg, html code.shiki .snmWg{--shiki-light:#27272A;--shiki-de